{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47738","headline":"赠僧昭莹 · 沈廷瑞","name":"赠僧昭莹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南北东西路，人生会不无。\n早曾依阁皂，又却上玄都。\n云片随天阔，泉声落石孤。\n何期早相遇，乐共煮菖蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈廷瑞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}